// TPM2_GetTestResult returns manufacturer-specific information regarding the
// results of a self-test and an indication of the test status.
//
// If TPM2_SelfTest() has not been executed and a testable function has not been
// tested, testResult will be TPM_RC_NEEDS_TEST. If TPM2_SelfTest() has been
// received and the tests are not complete, testResult will be TPM_RC_TESTING.
//
// If testing of all functions is complete without functional failures,
// testResult will be TPM_RC_SUCCESS. If any test failed, testResult will be
// TPM_RC_FAILURE.
TpmTestVector(
  name: "[TPM2_GetTestResult] Call without TPM2_SelfTest",
  spec_versions: [
    184,
  ],
  test_sequence: [
  ]
)
